title: '[pallet-revive] Add UncheckedRuntime precompile (call dispatch + raw storage reads)'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds the opt-in, feature-gated `UncheckedRuntime` precompile to `pallet-revive`,
      exposing two low-level primitives to contracts:

      - `dispatch(bytes)` — dispatch an arbitrary SCALE-encoded `RuntimeCall` as the
        calling contract's account (a `Signed` origin).
      - `getStorage(bytes)` — read the raw bytes of any runtime storage item by its
        full key.

      The precompile is gated behind the new, default-off `unchecked-precompiles`
      cargo feature and must be explicitly added to a runtime's `Config::Precompiles`
      to become active. Its interface is unchecked — pallet indices, call encodings
      and storage keys may change across runtime upgrades — and must not be enabled
      on production runtimes.

      Optional configuration type parameters:
      - `Filter: Contains<RuntimeCall>` (default `Everything`) restricts which calls
        may be dispatched; it is attached to the dispatch origin, so it also covers
        calls nested in `Utility::batch`, `Proxy::proxy`, etc.
      - `StorageFilter: Contains<Vec<u8>>` (default `Everything`) restricts which
        storage keys may be read.
      - `MaxValueLen: Get<u32>` is the value length `getStorage` charges up front
        (refunded to the actual length after the read); it defaults to — and is
        clamped at — the largest value whose ABI-encoded return fits the 128 KiB
        return-data cap.

      Storage keys are capped at `limits::UNCHECKED_RUNTIME_KEY_BYTES` (1 KiB),
      keeping the read weight inside its benchmarked domain. Both primitives are
      weight-metered with dedicated benchmarks.

crates:
  # `validate: false`: the SemVer check cannot build rustdoc JSON for these crates
  # because the `pallet-revive-fixtures` build script compiles contracts with
  # `-Z json-target-spec` (rustc 1.95+), which the SemVer toolchain rejects. The
  # declared bumps are intentionally conservative (`major`).
  - name: pallet-revive
    bump: major
    validate: false
  - name: pallet-revive-fixtures
    bump: major
    validate: false
